# uuid: Missing buffer bounds check in v3/v5/v6 when buf is provided
# GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq — Fixed in uuid 14.0.0
# The vulnerability only affects v3/v5/v6 when a custom `buf` parameter is passed.
# next-auth uses only uuid.v4() without a buf argument.
# Upgrading to uuid 14.0.0 is deferred until next-auth supports it upstream,
# to avoid ESM/CJS compatibility risk with next-auth JWT session handling.
GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq
